ch event\nThe iPhone XR is the most visually striking of the three new iPhone models. It comes in six colors.\nBesides the colorful bodies, the iPhone XR is easy to identify by its single lens camera.\nWhen I handled one, I could tell it was a little bit lighter than its siblings, the iPhone XS and iPhone XS Max.\nThat's because the XR is made out of stainless steel, as opposed to aluminum.\nSee the rest of the story at Business Insider", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=4fJVivmvcU8:MRh1hkuc1oM:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=4fJVivmvcU8:MRh1hkuc1oM:7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~3/4fJVivmvcU8/hands-on-iphone-xs-xs-max-and-xr-2018-9", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=4fJVivmvcU8:MRh1hkuc1oM:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=4fJVivmvcU8:MRh1hkuc1oM:bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~4/4fJVivmvcU8", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=4fJVivmvcU8:MRh1hkuc1oM:V_sGLiPBpWU", "https://www.businessinsider.com/hands-on-iphone-xs-xs-max-and-xr-2018-9#/#another-reason-why-the-xr-costs-at-least-749-as-opposed-to-999-is-because-it-uses-an-older-screen-technology-called-lcd-but-i-couldnt-tell-the-difference-between-the-iphone-xs-and-iphone-xr-displays-it-also-has-the-same-face-id-facial-recognition-sensor-as-last-years-iphone-x-and-this-years-iphone-xs-and-iphone-xs-max-thus-the-notch-up-top-4", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=QXVau8BzmBE", "https://www.businessinsider.com/appl